  "body": [
    "Roasted in small batches and ground to order. Not sure where to start? Reach for a house blend if you want the same lovely cup every day, a single origin when you want to taste somewhere specific, or instant for the mornings in a hurry.",
    "Blends & roasts",
    "Multi-origin blends built for consistency — the cup that tastes the same, morning after morning. Each comes ground, as whole beans, or in pods.",
    "A smooth, full-bodied blend to ease you into the day. Naturally balanced with a long, satisfying finish.",
    "Ground",
    "Whole bean",
    "Pods",
    "from $10",
    "Deep and warming — perfect for the moments that call for something bold.",
    "Ground",
    "Whole bean",
    "Pods",
    "from $10",
    "Bright, clean and energising. The one you reach for before anything else.",
    "Ground",
    "Whole bean",
    "Pods",
    "from $10",
    "All the warmth, none of the buzz. Swiss water process, naturally decaffeinated.",
    "Ground",
    "Whole bean",
    "Pods",
    "from $10",
    "Crafted for machines. Consistent, crema-rich, and deeply satisfying.",
    "Ground",
    "Whole bean",
    "Pods",
    "from $10",
    "Single origin",
    "Traceable, single-farm beans with a clear sense of where they grew. For the mornings you want to slow down and taste the difference — green beans too, if you roast your own.",
    "Traceable to a single farm in Yirgacheffe. A tribute to the art of careful growing.",
    "Ground",
    "Whole bean",
    "Raw bean",
